They are not guaranteed, but chances are that you will find one of the
following:

- potion of levitation
- ring of levitation
- boots of levitation
- boots of water walking
- a few wands of cold (to make a path of ice)
- perhaps some way to teleport yourself (if the level doesn't prevent
teleporting)
- polymorph into a creature that can swim or fly

there are probably more ways but the first 4 I mentioned are probably the
most
common ways to get to Medusa's island.

